@startuml
!theme plain
title OpenData Version 2.0.0 Operational Lifecycle

start
:Deploy compatible source/package,
SQL schema and documentation;
:Replace bootstrap credential
and certificate/private key;
:Verify directories, grants,
backup and working directory;

if (Configuration registered?) then (no)
  :Run --register with protected
override file;
  :Verify SQL configuration tables
and rewritten bootstrap file;
endif

:Run --list-plugins;
:Dry-run Ofgem and OpenMeteo;
note right
Octopus dry run is not usable
in the current baseline.
end note

if (Acceptance successful?) then (yes)
  :Run one controlled write
per selected plugin;
  :Verify final log, plugin summary,
audit rows and business data;
  if (Warnings or mismatches?) then (yes)
    :Stop further writes;
    :Retain evidence and reconcile
transactions, ledgers and archives;
    :Recover or correct configuration;
  else (no)
    :Permit routine operation;
    :Monitor logs, audit, pool,
source hashes and capacity;
  endif
else (no)
  :Diagnose configuration,
source and parser failures;
endif

stop
@enduml
